# Noted -> Marked migration manifests, deliberately kept on disk as local
# historical evidence of the completed migration (see 6a9d6e8). They are
# not used by deployment, rollback, or any migration tooling, and their
# document paths contain user UIDs, so they must never be committed.
/.migration/
